## 🐛 Troubleshooting

### Colors not updating?
- Clear browser cache
- Check design-system-colors.ts is imported
- Verify color values are valid hex codes

### Layout broken on mobile?
- Check gridTemplateColumns responsive settings
- Ensure minmax() breakpoints match your design
- Test in DevTools mobile view

### Performance issues?
- Check for unnecessary re-renders (React DevTools Profiler)
- Memoize heavy components
- Lazy load large lists
- Optimize API calls

